&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Global Bank team &lt;/strong&gt;builds the core infrastructure and services that give merchants a digital bank account, helping small businesses manage their money easily and reliably.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
