&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Backend Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll help modernize existing systems while balancing innovation with stability, collaborate with teams across regions, and build reliable services that manage diverse markets with different regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
